    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="320525d5-18b3-56f8-bc53-dc1cdfc73965" activityNameId="b046040e-6e5f-5f55-b2a4-ec604264125d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, burned in cogen 1MWe lean burn</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in cogen 1MWe lean burn
Singleoutput-process, copy of the related multioutput-processes with the same name extended by an appendix for the allocation method.;
UUID: d44b9dcc-79f2-326a-a3f8-ecb371a642da
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and substances needed for operation. Module "natural gas, high pressure, at consumer" is used; methane emissions from leakages due to distribution in low pressure network have been included (emission factor taken from Swiss module "natural gas, low pressure, at consumer, CH").
Location: Emissions and efficiencies adjusted to typical European conditions; extrapolated from German and Swiss emission regulations.
Technology: Average technology available on market.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature. Manufacturer information. 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d44b9dcc-79f2-326a-a3f8-ecb371a642da.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
